{"title": "Mithral Ore", "pageid": 4624, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mithral_Ore", "categories": ["Consumables", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mithral_Ore_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mithral_Ore_Icon.png/300px-Mithral_Ore_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/d/d6/Mithral_Ore_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Mithral Ore image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mithral_Ore_Icon.png/300px-Mithral_Ore_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Mithral_Ore_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Mithral Ore</b> is listed as a \"common\" <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumable</a> item, but only two exist in any playthrough. It is used for crafting adamantine armour or weapons, all of which have the <a href=\"/wiki/Reeling_(Condition)\" title=\"Reeling (Condition)\">Reeling</a> effect. Instructions and recipes are found in the book <a href=\"/wiki/The_Great_Furnace_of_Grymforge\" title=\"The Great Furnace of Grymforge\">The Great Furnace of Grymforge</a>. The crafting process is done at <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Forge_(location)\" title=\"Adamantine Forge (location)\">The Adamantine Forge</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Rough, unprocessed and raw - this mithral ore is ready to be fed into the forge.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Consumables\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumables</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 100 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  100  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-f1d4b2a694541ad8END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">f65292f7-a930-48a3-a803-914da4781056</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f65292f7-a930-48a3-a803-914da4781056\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f65292f7-a930-48a3-a803-914da4781056\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In two ore veins in the <a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_Refuge\" title=\"Abandoned Refuge\">Abandoned Refuge</a>\n<ul><li>One is northeast of the Adamantine Forge, across some lava, against the cavern wall at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-556&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;277</span></li>\n<li>The other is northwest of Abandoned Refuge, across some lava, next to a cliff at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-642&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;253</span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The six items which can be crafted using this ore are:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Longsword\" title=\"Adamantine Longsword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Longsword\" title=\"Adamantine Longsword\">Adamantine Longsword</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Mace\" title=\"Adamantine Mace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Adamantine_Mace_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Mace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Adamantine_Mace_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Adamantine_Mace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Adamantine_Mace_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Mace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Adamantine_Mace_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Mace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Adamantine_Mace_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Mace\" title=\"Adamantine Mace\">Adamantine Mace</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Scimitar\" title=\"Adamantine Scimitar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Scimitar\" title=\"Adamantine Scimitar\">Adamantine Scimitar</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Shield\" title=\"Adamantine Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Adamantine_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Shield\" title=\"Adamantine Shield\">Adamantine Shield</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Scale_Mail\" title=\"Adamantine Scale Mail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Adamantine_Scale_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Scale_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Adamantine_Scale_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Adamantine_Scale_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Adamantine_Scale_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Scale_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Adamantine_Scale_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Scale_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Adamantine_Scale_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Scale_Mail\" title=\"Adamantine Scale Mail\">Adamantine Scale Mail</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Splint_Armour\" title=\"Adamantine Splint Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Adamantine_Splint_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Splint_Armour\" title=\"Adamantine Splint Armour\">Adamantine Splint Armour</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>See also: the <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_set#Craftable\" title=\"Adamantine set\">Adamantine set</a></li>\n<li>Crafting one item uses up one Mithral Ore and only one ore can be obtained from each vein, meaning only two adamantine items can be crafted in any one game.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200114\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3197/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35004/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12470/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1183932/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.923      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   64.923      1 -total\n 44.20%   28.695      6 Template:RarityItem\n 42.76%   27.758      6 Template:Item_icon\n 29.71%   19.289     47 Template:Trim\n 25.47%   16.535      5 Template:Icon_text\n 14.31%    9.289     12 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n 12.82%    8.322     17 Template:Ifempty\n 12.31%    7.994      1 Template:Uuid\n 11.88%    7.715      1 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4624-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200114 and revision id 380282. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}